        "concentrate",
        "visual"
      ],
      "text": "The aqudel changes the intensity and pattern of their skin in a rapid pulse, attempting to disorient any creatures that can see them. Creatures within 30 feet of the aqudel must attempt a DC 25 Will save save. The aqudel can't use Strobe again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n---\nCritical Success The target is unaffected.\n\nSuccess The target is Dazzled for 1 round.\n\nFailure The target is dazzled for 1 minute and Stunned 1.\n\nCritical Failure The target is dazzled for 1 minute and Stunned 2"
